{# The invitation to review a content plan, sent by hand by the studio.

   The link is new: a link's token only exists in clear text when it is
   created, so the address of a link already issued cannot be sent again. The
   previous one has just been revoked, and the message says so rather than
   leaving someone wondering why their old bookmark no longer answers.

   The pending count is in the body and in the subject: it is what decides
   whether to open it now or tonight. #}
<p>{{ 'studio.email.space_review.body'|trans({'{space}': space.name, '{count}': awaiting}) }}</p>

<p><a href="{{ url }}">{{ 'studio.email.space_review.cta'|trans }}</a></p>

<p>{{ 'studio.email.space_review.replaces'|trans }}</p>

<p>{{ 'studio.email.space_review.expires'|trans({'{date}': expiresAt|site_date}) }}</p>
